{"id":14657,"date":"2021-04-23T00:00:00","date_gmt":"2021-04-23T06:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.rethinkfirst.com\/resources\/determining-medical-necessity-how-evidenced-based-protocols-can-support-proper-dosage-and-clinical-outcomes\/"},"modified":"2025-09-01T18:15:25","modified_gmt":"2025-09-01T22:15:25","slug":"determining-medical-necessity-how-evidenced-based-protocols-can-support-proper-dosage-and-clinical-outcomes","status":"publish","type":"resources","link":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/resources\/determining-medical-necessity-how-evidenced-based-protocols-can-support-proper-dosage-and-clinical-outcomes\/","title":{"rendered":"Determining Medical Necessity: How Evidence-Based Protocols Can Support Proper Dosage and Clinical Outcomes"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"14657\" class=\"elementor elementor-14657\" data-elementor-post-type=\"resources\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-45340828 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"45340828\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-427bbc16\" data-id=\"427bbc16\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-752713b9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"752713b9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><em>Data discussed is based on prior version of the Medical Necessity Assessment (MNA) tool. MNA has been updated effective 7\/15\/2024.<\/em><\/p>\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" style=\"margin-bottom: 30px;\" \/>\n<div id=\"videoDivHolder\">\n<div><video poster=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/485-MTExNDYzNQ_determining-medical-necessity_thumbnail.jpg\" controls=\"controls\" width=\"300\" height=\"150\"> <source src=\"https:\/\/rtaprodmarketing.blob.core.windows.net\/rta-prod-marketingvideos\/485-MTExNDYzNQ_determining-medical-necessity.mp4\" type=\"video\/mp4\" \/> <\/video><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p><style> #videoDivHolder { width: 100%; max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; } #videoDivHolder > div { position: relative; overflow: hidden; width: 100%; padding-top: 56.25%; } #videoDivHolder > div video { position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; bottom: 0; right: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; } <\/style><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Join us on Thursday, April 22 when we will discuss preliminary data from over 6,000 completed assessments and how Rethink&#8217;s new Medical Necessity Assessment can help you:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Enhance care outcomes by ensuring accurate care plans and the correct level of prescribed hours<\/li>\n<li>Align providers and payers on necessary dosage levels and facilitate <a href=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/our-solutions\/practice-management\/\">pre-authorizations<\/a><\/li>\n<li>Provide evidenced-based recommendations to new BCBAs and support their training process<\/li>\n<li>Standardize levels of care across your organization<\/li>\n<li>Increase parent satisfaction<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>There is no cost to attend and this webinar is not eligible for CEUs.<\/p>\n<h2>About the Guest Presenters<\/h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-1ab6852 authorSection elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"1ab6852\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-0cd6e2f\" data-id=\"0cd6e2f\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a6fddf6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"a6fddf6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/dr-diana-davis-wilson-dbh-lba-bcba.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-18116\" alt=\"Dr. Diana Davis-Wilson, DBH, LBA, BCBA\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/dr-diana-davis-wilson-dbh-lba-bcba.jpg 600w, https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/dr-diana-davis-wilson-dbh-lba-bcba-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/dr-diana-davis-wilson-dbh-lba-bcba-150x150.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-66 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-1c41156\" data-id=\"1c41156\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f22b6e9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f22b6e9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Dr. Diana Davis-Wilson, DBH, LBA, BCBA<\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"color: #333333;\">Behavior Analyst<\/span><\/p>\n<p>Dr. Diana Davis-Wilson, DBH, LBA, BCBA is a licensed behavior analyst, with several years of experience providing consultation and training to families, school districts, and organizational personnel nationwide. She holds a Doctorate of Behavior Health with an emphasis on integrated health care management and is currently the Chief Executive Advisor for <a href=\"https:\/\/aspenbehavioral.com\/our-team\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Aspen Behavioral Consulting<\/a>.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-186027d authorSection elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"186027d\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-59534ac\" data-id=\"59534ac\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6fd9525 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"6fd9525\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/mellanie-page-bcba.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-18121\" alt=\"Headshot of Mellanie Page\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/mellanie-page-bcba.jpg 600w, https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/mellanie-page-bcba-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/mellanie-page-bcba-150x150.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-66 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-7a35a69\" data-id=\"7a35a69\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ae443b7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ae443b7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Mellanie Page, BCBA<\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"color: #333333;\">VP of Operations and Regional Director at <a href=\"https:\/\/www.abskids.com\/about\/team\/mellanie-page\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">ABS Kids<\/a><\/span><\/p>\n<p>Mellanie Page is a BCBA who has worked in the field of ABA for several years, utilizing a variety of strategies to teach new skills to children, their caregivers, and providers. She has supported BCBA candidates through supervision and instruction at National University. She is certified in OBM practices and uses this experience to improve and enhance organizational operations.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"author":19,"featured_media":15003,"template":"","meta":{"_seopress_robots_primary_cat":"","_seopress_titles_title":"Webinar: Medical Necessity Protocols Support Dosage, Outcome","_seopress_titles_desc":"Rethink\u2019s Medical Necessity Assessment can help you enhance care outcomes by ensuring accurate care plans and the correct level of prescribed hours and more.","_seopress_robots_index":"","om_disable_all_campaigns":false,"_links_to":"","_links_to_target":""},"audience":[70],"resource-type":[72],"resource-topic":[69,75,354],"resource-tag":[100,172,324,133,339],"class_list":["post-14657","resources","type-resources","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","audience-providers","resource-type-webinar","resource-topic-business","resource-topic-medical-necessity","resource-topic-parenting","resource-tag-bcba","resource-tag-data","resource-tag-member-engagement","resource-tag-parents","resource-tag-success"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/resources\/14657","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/resources"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/resources"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/19"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/resources\/14657\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":24069,"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/resources\/14657\/revisions\/24069"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/15003"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=14657"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"audience","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/audience?post=14657"},{"taxonomy":"resource-type","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/resource-type?post=14657"},{"taxonomy":"resource-topic","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/